libg15render
------------------------------------------
This is a library to render text and shapes into a buffer usable by the
Logitech G15 Gaming Keyboard.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libfreetype-devel-2.13.3-1
  libfreetype6-2.13.3-1
  libg15-devel-3.0.7-1bl2
  libg15render-devel-3.0.5-1bl1
  libg15render3-3.0.5-1bl1
  pkg-config-3.0.10-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  autoconf-20260320-3
  automake-20261107-1
  binutils-2.47-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  libfreetype-devel-2.13.3-1
  libg15-devel-3.0.7-1bl2
  libtool-2.6.2-1
  make-4.4.1-2

Canonical website:
  https://gitlab.com/menelkir/libg15render

Canonical download:
  https://gitlab.com/menelkir/libg15render/-/archive/3.0.5a/libg15render-3.0.5a.tar.bz2

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack libg15render-3.0.5-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./libg15render-3.0.5-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/libg15render-3.0.5-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libg15render-3.0.5-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libg15render3-3.0.5-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libg15render-devel-3.0.5-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(libg15render)
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/libg15render.README
  /usr/share/doc/libg15render/AUTHORS
  /usr/share/doc/libg15render/COPYING
  /usr/share/doc/libg15render/ChangeLog
  /usr/share/doc/libg15render/NEWS
  /usr/share/doc/libg15render/README
  /usr/share/doc/libg15render/README.rst

(libg15render3)
  /usr/bin/cygg15render-3.dll

(libg15render-devel)
  /usr/include/libg15render.h
  /usr/lib/libg15render.dll.a
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/libg15render.pc
  /usr/share/man/man3/libg15render.3.gz

